dtPlay — Common Desktop Environment (CDE) Media Player & 60s Clip Trimmer
A clean, fast CDE OSF/Motif clone of VLC for Music & Movies.

Supported Formats:
  Audio: .wav, .mp3, .m4a, .flac, .ogg, .oga, .opus, .aac, .wma, .au, .snd, .aiff, .aif
  Video: .mp4, .m4v, .mov, .avi, .mpeg, .mpg, .mkv, .webm, .ogv, .wmv, .3gp, .flv, .ts, .m2ts

Features:
  - Opens to ~/Music in dtMail's classic vintage greenbar alternating-row file browser
  - Includes '..' parent folder row at the top for browsing anywhere on disk
  - Double-clicking any song or movie plays it; '◀ Back to List' returns to the browser
  - Native GStreamer gtksink video stage + retro CDE audio spectrum / cover art visualizer
  - True borderless fullscreen toggle (F11 / F / Full Screen button / double-click video)
  - '✂ Make a Clip' button: captures up to 60 seconds starting from current playback position
    and opens it in a second dtPlay Clip Studio window to trim further or Save As!
"""

